  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive multisectoral humanitarian assistance for crisis-affected people in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique faces a convergence of crises, including ongoing conflict and recurrent disasters. The proposed action aims to address urgent humanitarian needs in northern Mozambique, particularly in the provinces of Cabo Delgado, Nampula, and Niassa to internally displaced persons (IDPs), returnees, and host communities. The intervention focuses on providing life-saving assistance while fostering resilience and addressing vulnerabilities through a multi-sectoral approach.</narrative>
  </description>
